$$\left| \frac{26}{7} - \frac{88 x}{7} \right| = \frac{81}{7}$$

$$ \frac{26}{7} - \frac{88 x}{7} = \frac{81}{7} \quad \text{or} \quad \frac{26}{7} - \frac{88 x}{7} = -\frac{81}{7}$$

$$ -\frac{88 x}{7} = \frac{81}{7} - \frac{26}{7}$$

$$ -\frac{88 x}{7} = \frac{55}{7}$$

$$ x = -\frac{55}{7} \cdot \frac{7}{88}$$

$$ x = -\frac{5}{8}$$

$$ x = -\frac{5}{88}$$

Therefore, the only real solution to the equation is $x = -\frac{5}{88}$.
